<title>CHINA: China's Jan-June coal imports down by 55.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-June coal imports down by 55.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 680,000 tonnes of coal in the first half of 1997, down by 55.2 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal     680,000	     140,000	  -55.2</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	 YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal     14.01 million     2.82 million   +22.7</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
